# Overrides the root .dockerignore for `-f backend/Dockerfile` builds only.
#
# Kept beside web/Dockerfile.dockerignore so the two images have symmetric,
# self-describing rules rather than one relying on the root file and the other
# overriding it. Contents mirror the root .dockerignore.

**/.env
**/.env.*
backend/.venv/
backend/tests/
web/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
docs/
infra/
mobile-android/
mobile-ios/
*.md
.claude/
